---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const faqs = [
  ['What is Native Ceuticals Skincare?', 'Native Ceuticals Skincare is a complete skincare line designed to cleanse, hydrate, protect, repair, and improve the look of the skin. The line includes Day Cream, Dual Action Cleanser, Mineral Sunscreen, Night Cream, and Retinol Serum.'],
  ['What is the best routine using these products?', 'Start with the Dual Action Cleanser to clean the skin. In the morning, follow with Day Cream and Mineral Sunscreen. At night, cleanse again, apply Retinol Serum, and finish with Night Cream.'],
  ['Can I use all five products together?', 'Yes. These products are designed to work together as a complete skincare routine. Each product has a specific role, from cleansing and daytime hydration to sun protection and overnight repair.'],
  ['Which product should I use first?', 'Always start with the Dual Action Cleanser. Clean skin allows the next products to apply better and work more effectively.'],
  ['Which product should I use during the day?', 'Use Day Cream in the morning for hydration and daily skin support. Follow with Mineral Sunscreen to protect your skin from sun exposure.'],
  ['Which product should I use at night?', 'Use the Retinol Serum at night after cleansing, then apply the Night Cream once the serum has absorbed. This helps support smoother, hydrated, and refreshed-looking skin by morning.'],
  ['Are these products made with clean ingredients?', 'Yes. The formulas are made with high-quality botanical and skin-supporting ingredients such as aloe vera, rose hydrosol, raspberry oil, carrot seed oil, jojoba oil, kokum butter, mango butter, hyaluronic acid, Vitamin C, Vitamin E, and CBG.'],
  ['Are the products THC-free?', 'Yes. The skincare products are marked as THC-free, making them a clean topical option for customers who want skincare support without THC.'],
  ['Are these products lab-tested?', 'Yes. Each product is backed by a Certificate of Analysis, also known as a COA. This verifies product quality, potency, and transparency, so customers know exactly what they are using.'],
  ['Who should not use these products?', 'These products are not for use by anyone under 18, or by women who may be pregnant or nursing. Anyone with sensitive skin, allergies, existing skin conditions, or medical concerns should consult a physician before use.']
];
---
<BaseLayout title="Frequently Asked Questions | Serum 72" description="Answers to common questions about Serum 72 products and skincare routines.">
  <header class="page-hero"><p class="eyebrow">GOT QUESTIONS?</p><h1>Everything You Need to Know</h1><p>From ingredients to delivery — find quick answers to our most common questions below.</p></header>
  <article class="content wide-content"><p class="eyebrow">FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS</p><h2>Common questions.</h2><div class="faq-list">{faqs.map(([q,a], i) => <details open={i === 0}><summary>{q}</summary><p>{a}</p></details>)}</div></article>
  <section class="page-cta"><h2>Ready to Reveal Your Best Skin?</h2><p>Start your glow journey today.</p><a class="btn" href="/shop/">READY TO REVEAL</a></section>
</BaseLayout>
